        }
      ],
      "extract": "Taken together with other advantages, including lower cost, less potential for drug–drug interactions, lower pill burden and availability in once-daily fixed-dose combinations, DTG is recommended as the preferred ARV drug for second-line ART among adults, adolescents and children for whom a non-DTG-based first-line regimen has failed. For those taking a first-line regimen containing DTG that has failed, a boosted",
